  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $ABH$에서 $\\overline{AB} = 6\\rm,cm$, $\\angle BAH = 30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{AH} = \\overline{AB} \\times \\cos 30^\\circ = 6 \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = 3\\sqrt{3}\\rm,cm$$ 직각삼각형 $AHC$에서 $\\angle HAC = 45^\\circ$이므로 $$\\cos 45^\\circ = \\dfrac{\\overline{AH}}{\\overline{AC}}$$ $$\\overline{AC} = \\dfrac{\\overline{AH}}{\\cos 45^\\circ} = \\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{2}/2} = \\dfrac{6\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{2}} = 3\\sqrt{6}\\rm,cm$$ 따라서 정답은 ③이다."
